From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Stained Glass OS <ke7oxh@gmail.com>
Date: Mon, 12 Oct 2026 13:04:41 -0700
Subject: [PATCH] vssapi: requester interface with no providers, snapshot
 helpers, writer state

CreateVssBackupComponents now returns a working IVssBackupComponents that
enforces the documented call sequence (initialize, set context and backup
state, gather metadata) with no writers and no snapshot providers: volumes are
not supported, Query returns empty enumerations, async operations are already
finished. Adds IVssAsync, IVssEnumObject, VSS_OBJECT_PROP, VSS_PROVIDER_PROP
and the VSS_E_* codes to vss.idl. Implements IsVolumeSnapshotted,
ShouldBlockRevert and VssFreeSnapshotProperties (and the *Internal names), and
CVssWriter::Initialize/Subscribe/Unsubscribe/destructor now track state
(BAD_STATE and ALREADY_SUBSCRIBED errors) in a side table keyed by the writer.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01XZFS4SPPzeH5d2c1MuzqCS

